  "jobTitle": "Software Engineer",
  "summary": "I'm a full-stack engineer who ships fast - not by cutting corners, but by leveraging AI tooling to move at a pace that used to require a whole team.\n\nOver the past 5 years, I've built enterprise web applications at Konica Minolta (React/TypeScript, Node.js, AWS), but what sets me apart is how I work: I use AI-driven development workflows to break down complex problems, explore solutions systematically, and deliver production-ready code at a speed that consistently outpaces traditional approaches.\n\nMy approach isn't about blindly generating code. It's about asking the right questions - decomposing problems into their core components, stress-testing approaches against edge cases, and building faster by leveraging AI as a thinking partner.  The result: I ship features in hours that typically take days.\n\nWhat I bring to the table:\n- Full-stack production experience (React/TS, Node.js, C#, AWS, Terraform)\n- Performance testing, code audits, identifying big picture issues\n- Internal tooling mindset - I build systems that eliminate repetitive work\n- AI-native workflow expertise - LLM orchestration, agentic systems, automation pipelines\n\nI'm exploring my next opportunity where I can bring this velocity to a team that values AI-forward engineering. Open to senior full-stack, AI platform, or developer experience roles in the NYC metro area or remote.\n\nLet's connect - I'd love to talk about how AI-augmented development is changing what a single engineer can accomplish.",
