    "description": "Building enterprise document management and workflow platforms across KM's internal product ecosystem.\n\nKey highlights:\n\n• Built internal data automation tooling that streamlined large-scale database operations, reducing what used to be manual multi-hour processes to minutes\n• Identified and fixed sitewide frontend performance issues by analyzing React profiler data, eliminating redundant API calls across the application\n• Contributed to full-stack feature development, architecture planning, and schema design across multiple enterprise platforms\n• Became the team's go-to resource for complex database migrations, data cleanup operations, and infrastructure troubleshooting\n• Diagnosed and resolved a critical CI/CD pipeline failure - traced corrupted Terraform plan artifacts to a race condition in parallel Terragrunt execution, a bug that had silently affected production deployments",
